(135651, 6674, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t have worked in the last challenge, but it definately works here!  Love the way the reflection splits up in the broken pieces of glass.  I''m not sure the relevance of the sea shells here, were they part of the mirror?  They do add some pretty-ness to the photo though.  Lighting is good, and I like how this fills the frame.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Wouldn''t have worked in the last challenge, but it definately works here!  Love the way the reflection splits up in the broken pieces of glass.  I''m not sure the relevance of the sea shells here, were they part of the mirror?  They do add some pretty-ness to the photo though.  Lighting is good, and I like how this fills the frame.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
