(135659, 6676, 3080, '<td valign="top">Ahh!  Mosquito breeding ground!  This is definately garbage.  And it''s not icky.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the formation of the tires.  The upper right is a bit bright, and the lower left is in shadow, so it kind of doesn''t "flow" through the photo, but it''s not disturbing.  Overall nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Ahh!  Mosquito breeding ground!  This is definately garbage.  And it''s not icky.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the formation of the tires.  The upper right is a bit bright, and the lower left is in shadow, so it kind of doesn''t "flow" through the photo, but it''s not disturbing.  Overall nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
