(135731, 6684, 3419, '<td valign="top">Awwwww! Did he really do that, or did you stage him? He''s so cute! The exposure on your dog is a little dark; try experimenting with different apertures and shutter speeds to capture more detail.</td>', 'Awwwww! Did he really do that, or did you stage him? He''s so cute! The exposure on your dog is a little dark; try experimenting with different apertures and shutter speeds to capture more detail.', '2002-10-07 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
