(135733, 6684, 3655, '<td valign="top">This is not a bad shot. I would not use the white floor and background. The dog is looking at the camera. Try adding food to the paper or in the basket. the dog might look at the basket or stick his head in. This looks like it should be natural, not pose. The art is posing a shot and not making it look like it is posed or making people not care that it is. It is simple but not easy. good luck -milton<br/></td>', 'This is not a bad shot. I would not use the white floor and background. The dog is looking at the camera. Try adding food to the paper or in the basket. the dog might look at the basket or stick his head in. This looks like it should be natural, not pose. The art is posing a shot and not making it look like it is posed or making people not care that it is. It is simple but not easy. good luck -milton', '2002-10-08 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
