(135906, 6701, 3080, '<td valign="top">Diet coke and junk food.  Funny.  What I like here, is that not only is the trash can rusty, but everything inside is almost the same color too.  The angle is good, and the focus is also good.  LOL, my 2 year old just says "OH NO! There a pop in a garbage!"  We have Michigan 10cent refund here, and are always telling him not to put the cans in the garbage. LOL, at least he''s learning something.  The shot is technically well done, but creativity is low.  Unfortunately, there are about 100 shots like this in the challenge.  But this one is a bit higher because of the color coordination of your garbage. :) Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Diet coke and junk food.  Funny.  What I like here, is that not only is the trash can rusty, but everything inside is almost the same color too.  The angle is good, and the focus is also good.  LOL, my 2 year old just says "OH NO! There a pop in a garbage!"  We have Michigan 10cent refund here, and are always telling him not to put the cans in the garbage. LOL, at least he''s learning something.  The shot is technically well done, but creativity is low.  Unfortunately, there are about 100 shots like this in the challenge.  But this one is a bit higher because of the color coordination of your garbage. :) Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
