(136020, 6712, 3730, '<td valign="top">nice color contrast, but the centering of it doesn''t quite work for me...also a bit more contrast would probably give it more ''punch'' ....I still like the feel of the image though, and for that I give you 7</td>', 'nice color contrast, but the centering of it doesn''t quite work for me...also a bit more contrast would probably give it more ''punch'' ....I still like the feel of the image though, and for that I give you 7', '2002-10-13 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136021, 6714, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition, I just wish I could see more of the cats head and/or face. DPz</td>', 'Nice color and composition, I just wish I could see more of the cats head and/or face. DPz', '2002-10-07 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136022, 6714, 3111, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have worked better on a more "cat" scale.  Also, I am not sure what end of the scale I was looking at (5) Mark Rob</td>', 'I think this shot would have worked better on a more "cat" scale.  Also, I am not sure what end of the scale I was looking at (5) Mark Rob', '2002-10-07 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136023, 6714, 3859, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the only thing this picture does for me is scare me!  Big undefinable animal (if not for your title) getting into some really wicked looking garbage....Yeow!   So I guess if the gross garbage got to me, then you succeeded there, but I think if you had taken the picture from a different angle, perhaps showing more of the cat''s face it would look less like a snapshot!</td>', 'Sorry, but the only thing this picture does for me is scare me!  Big undefinable animal (if not for your title) getting into some really wicked looking garbage....Yeow!   So I guess if the gross garbage got to me, then you succeeded there, but I think if you had taken the picture from a different angle, perhaps showing more of the cat''s face it would look less like a snapshot!', '2002-10-07 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136024, 6714, 327, '<td valign="top">My kitty is baaaaad too. Good luck. Justine</td>', 'My kitty is baaaaad too. Good luck. Justine', '2002-10-07 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
