(136027, 6714, 3419, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t mentioned cats in your photo title, I would not have recognized the cat in the foreground (it''s too dark, and only the ears provide a clue as to what it is). Good creative idea.</td>', 'If you hadn''t mentioned cats in your photo title, I would not have recognized the cat in the foreground (it''s too dark, and only the ears provide a clue as to what it is). Good creative idea.', '2002-10-08 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
