(136041, 6715, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not just ordinary garbage...That''s some "weird shit!" LOL!  Very nice capture.  Your angle and framing/cropping are great to have gotten that little "grafiti" in there.  The dog is an interesting touch making me wonder what kind of smelly stuff is in there.  Focus and clarity are great.  Overall a really nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Not just ordinary garbage...That''s some "weird shit!" LOL!  Very nice capture.  Your angle and framing/cropping are great to have gotten that little "grafiti" in there.  The dog is an interesting touch making me wonder what kind of smelly stuff is in there.  Focus and clarity are great.  Overall a really nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
