(136162, 6725, 3112, '<td valign="top">I think the title is really good for the photo.  It is a tad overexposed and soft on the fence, which actually detracts from the garbage inside.  I know AF is hard to use on such a busy subject, but you can ompensate a bit by stopping the lens down to give a greater depth, and, effectively give you a better margin f error for focus.</td>', 'I think the title is really good for the photo.  It is a tad overexposed and soft on the fence, which actually detracts from the garbage inside.  I know AF is hard to use on such a busy subject, but you can ompensate a bit by stopping the lens down to give a greater depth, and, effectively give you a better margin f error for focus.', '2002-10-11 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
