(136175, 6726, 1143, '<td valign="top">You found a great subject for the shot. However, the picture seems a little faded and bland with no strong colors. Maybe a lower perspective could have included some blue water or sky. A sunset in the bg would be great also. I would go back, if possible, and take more shots of this great find.  ~indigo997</td>', 'You found a great subject for the shot. However, the picture seems a little faded and bland with no strong colors. Maybe a lower perspective could have included some blue water or sky. A sunset in the bg would be great also. I would go back, if possible, and take more shots of this great find.  ~indigo997', '2002-10-07 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136176, 6726, 3730, '<td valign="top">One of the best this week. I really like the ''dead'' look feel of it which adds to the overall feeling. Great job.</td>', 'One of the best this week. I really like the ''dead'' look feel of it which adds to the overall feeling. Great job.', '2002-10-07 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
