(136186, 6726, 3111, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot - the thumbnail made it look like a whole boat.  Rather cool.  OI bet the weather made the picture a little grey.  I can''t fault you for that, there is only so much you can do in a week... This is one of my favorites this week. (9) MarkRob</td>', 'Terrific shot - the thumbnail made it look like a whole boat.  Rather cool.  OI bet the weather made the picture a little grey.  I can''t fault you for that, there is only so much you can do in a week... This is one of my favorites this week. (9) MarkRob', '2002-10-11 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136187, 6726, 3112, '<td valign="top">Increase contrast in this one to separate the grey of the boat from the grey of the rocks. Good composition, though.</td>', 'Increase contrast in this one to separate the grey of the boat from the grey of the rocks. Good composition, though.', '2002-10-11 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136188, 6726, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, I like everything about it. Where is it taken? Somewhere in the Northeast? Or around the Great Lakes? Seen some places in Maine that look like that...</td>', 'Very nice picture, I like everything about it. Where is it taken? Somewhere in the Northeast? Or around the Great Lakes? Seen some places in Maine that look like that...', '2002-10-11 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
