(136190, 6726, 4564, '<td valign="top">Nice framing. Nice textures. Very good try at finding an interesting subject with the current theme.   Framing ould be improved to make the photo more dynamic.  Great effort though. 7/10</td>', 'Nice framing. Nice textures. Very good try at finding an interesting subject with the current theme.   Framing ould be improved to make the photo more dynamic.  Great effort though. 7/10', '2002-10-12 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
