(136194, 6726, 3080, '<td valign="top">nice shot!  I really like how it is still on the waters edge.  kind of like people wanting to be burried somewhere that they really loved, or in a place that meant something to them.  The little weeds are a nice touch.  Garbage without being unpleasant to look at.  Ver nice shot.  angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  The lighting conditions are great, and the surrounds are really beautiful.  Excelent. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'nice shot!  I really like how it is still on the waters edge.  kind of like people wanting to be burried somewhere that they really loved, or in a place that meant something to them.  The little weeds are a nice touch.  Garbage without being unpleasant to look at.  Ver nice shot.  angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  The lighting conditions are great, and the surrounds are really beautiful.  Excelent. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136195, 6726, 2923, '<td valign="top">there is a lot you can do with these boat photos but i am not sure looking down at it is that effective, maybe have it in context with the water might be better. 7 paganini</td>', 'there is a lot you can do with these boat photos but i am not sure looking down at it is that effective, maybe have it in context with the water might be better. 7 paganini', '2002-10-13 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
