(136197, 6726, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting and textures. This would probably look excellent in black and white as well (I''m sure lots of people have said that), but I do like the colours here. They''re very soft and subtle, and give it the right kind of weatherbeaten look. 10 - lisae</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting and textures. This would probably look excellent in black and white as well (I''m sure lots of people have said that), but I do like the colours here. They''re very soft and subtle, and give it the right kind of weatherbeaten look. 10 - lisae', '2002-10-13 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136198, 6726, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific shot.  Good job and congratulations!  Grayce</td>', 'This is a terrific shot.  Good job and congratulations!  Grayce', '2002-10-14 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(136199, 6726, 1202, '<td valign="top">The boat looks like it has been there so long that it belongs.   I came real close to marking it down because the historic value makes it miss the topic of garbage.   Good job.   Autool</td>', 'The boat looks like it has been there so long that it belongs.   I came real close to marking it down because the historic value makes it miss the topic of garbage.   Good job.   Autool', '2002-10-14 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
