(136201, 6727, 51167, '<td valign="top">wow, what happened here?  There are bins like this in the warehouse of the company I work.  I would have liked to know what caused this. 7 Jubei</td>', 'wow, what happened here?  There are bins like this in the warehouse of the company I work.  I would have liked to know what caused this. 7 Jubei', '2002-10-07 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136202, 6727, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. I immediatly thought of the title, "Garbage in Pastel".  I wonder if you worked with the color or this is natural.  Either way, I like it. One "little" thing...it seems a bit busy or confusing at the right center.  I wonder if you shot this from different angles.  Nice job.  DPz</td>', 'Nice colors. I immediatly thought of the title, "Garbage in Pastel".  I wonder if you worked with the color or this is natural.  Either way, I like it. One "little" thing...it seems a bit busy or confusing at the right center.  I wonder if you shot this from different angles.  Nice job.  DPz', '2002-10-07 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
