(136209, 6727, 3080, '<td valign="top">That is a whole lot of pallets.  It looks like the shelving in the foreground colapsed??  Definately garbage now, what ever happened.  Ok, My hubby works for Minute Maid, and I see some Tropicana boxes, and he just confirmed, that it looks like this one either got knocked down (and someone fired) or it colapsed.  That scares me cause he works in the warehouse in the exact same conditions as this.  Anyway, nice angle to capture this.  Also might qualify as a doc. or journalism photo too.  Your focus is really good.  Lighting conditions are favorable for the shot.  Nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'That is a whole lot of pallets.  It looks like the shelving in the foreground colapsed??  Definately garbage now, what ever happened.  Ok, My hubby works for Minute Maid, and I see some Tropicana boxes, and he just confirmed, that it looks like this one either got knocked down (and someone fired) or it colapsed.  That scares me cause he works in the warehouse in the exact same conditions as this.  Anyway, nice angle to capture this.  Also might qualify as a doc. or journalism photo too.  Your focus is really good.  Lighting conditions are favorable for the shot.  Nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136210, 6729, 3746, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2002-10-07 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
