(136212, 6729, 4049, '<td valign="top">Rubbermaid is a very high quality brand of trashcan, good choice, you have good garbage sense.</td>', 'Rubbermaid is a very high quality brand of trashcan, good choice, you have good garbage sense.', '2002-10-07 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
