(136214, 6729, 3080, '<td valign="top">Up late working on photos.  Kind of like me most nights.  I love the angle here, the perspective is really nice.  I even like how it''s not a direct shot of the garbage, but also shows the rubbermaid logo of the trash can.  I think the use of black and white is great here.  Some of the color trash photos I''ve seen have been unimpressive.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Up late working on photos.  Kind of like me most nights.  I love the angle here, the perspective is really nice.  I even like how it''s not a direct shot of the garbage, but also shows the rubbermaid logo of the trash can.  I think the use of black and white is great here.  Some of the color trash photos I''ve seen have been unimpressive.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136215, 6729, 2123, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and the choice of black and white here. 10</td>', 'I love the angle and the choice of black and white here. 10', '2002-10-10 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
