(136441, 6745, 1143, '<td valign="top">Ewe Gross! Surely you didn''t put your head in that bucket just for a picture!  ;oP  <br/>FYI, I have been giving my dog 3 heparin shots a day for a long time and that is why I have so many used needles that I am not afraid to touch. I haven''t snapped off the tip because I am not going to put them in my home garbage but, rather, return them to the vet for disposal. Just wanted you to know that I didn''t cheat. IMO, I think that your pic has a lot more shock value than mine, and you did a good job with it considering the circumstances.  ~indigo997</td>', 'Ewe Gross! Surely you didn''t put your head in that bucket just for a picture!  ;oP  FYI, I have been giving my dog 3 heparin shots a day for a long time and that is why I have so many used needles that I am not afraid to touch. I haven''t snapped off the tip because I am not going to put them in my home garbage but, rather, return them to the vet for disposal. Just wanted you to know that I didn''t cheat. IMO, I think that your pic has a lot more shock value than mine, and you did a good job with it considering the circumstances.  ~indigo997', '2002-10-08 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
