(136494, 6751, 2221, '<td valign="top">If you want to know what happened the day before, please see the photo details.<br/>In reply to ggosling about the upper left corner: I tried and had a cropped version without the triangle. Then the curbstone was aligned with the left side of the photo. But it was not better. Without it the photo just missed the perspective and thus losing it''s depth. So I only desaturated the color of the grass so that the triangle does not distract so much.<br/>Thanks for your comments.</td>', 'If you want to know what happened the day before, please see the photo details.In reply to ggosling about the upper left corner: I tried and had a cropped version without the triangle. Then the curbstone was aligned with the left side of the photo. But it was not better. Without it the photo just missed the perspective and thus losing it''s depth. So I only desaturated the color of the grass so that the triangle does not distract so much.Thanks for your comments.', '2002-10-14 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
