(136626, 6757, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately garbage now.  My only complaint about this photo is that I wish the water were a bit calmer.  As it is, with the ripples around the fish, it looks like the fish might be moving a bit.  I trust your word that''s he in fact dead, but the ripples kind of are out of place here.  I think I might understand the ripples though, as without them, it would just be a dead fish in dark water.  So maybe they make this a bit more interesting.  Lighting is good, and focus is also very nice.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Definately garbage now.  My only complaint about this photo is that I wish the water were a bit calmer.  As it is, with the ripples around the fish, it looks like the fish might be moving a bit.  I trust your word that''s he in fact dead, but the ripples kind of are out of place here.  I think I might understand the ripples though, as without them, it would just be a dead fish in dark water.  So maybe they make this a bit more interesting.  Lighting is good, and focus is also very nice.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
