(136641, 6759, 3080, '<td valign="top">Lovely angle and perspective.  your negative space is also quite nice.  I love how the red stands out on the blue.  With this angle you also keep out anything on the ground that could be distracting, or that would make the photo too busy.  At first I didn''t like the light glare, but then thought that it might be a bit dull without it, so it''s good to have it there, I think.  nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Lovely angle and perspective.  your negative space is also quite nice.  I love how the red stands out on the blue.  With this angle you also keep out anything on the ground that could be distracting, or that would make the photo too busy.  At first I didn''t like the light glare, but then thought that it might be a bit dull without it, so it''s good to have it there, I think.  nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
