(136699, 6766, 1827, '<td valign="top">This shot is well-composed.  The only problem I see if there are lots of JPG artifacts in the image.  It look s very overcompressed.  I see the size is under 40K.  You will do better if you optimize your photos as close to 150K as possible.  There have been some forum threads on how to do this if you wanna search; or you can PM me and I can try to help.  5, just-married (would have been a 7-8 without jpg issues.)</td>', 'This shot is well-composed.  The only problem I see if there are lots of JPG artifacts in the image.  It look s very overcompressed.  I see the size is under 40K.  You will do better if you optimize your photos as close to 150K as possible.  There have been some forum threads on how to do this if you wanna search; or you can PM me and I can try to help.  5, just-married (would have been a 7-8 without jpg issues.)', '2002-10-07 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
