(136735, 6770, 3080, '<td valign="top">THe pink flowers are so out of focus they are really distracting from the garbage here.  The garbage is in great focus though.  Lighting on the garbage is great, but the flower (that appears) closest to the camera is kind of too bright, or has some kind of strange glare on it.  The angle and framing/cropping you have chosen is nice.  Overall a nice idea, but I think it is brought down by the oof flowers.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'THe pink flowers are so out of focus they are really distracting from the garbage here.  The garbage is in great focus though.  Lighting on the garbage is great, but the flower (that appears) closest to the camera is kind of too bright, or has some kind of strange glare on it.  The angle and framing/cropping you have chosen is nice.  Overall a nice idea, but I think it is brought down by the oof flowers.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-11 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
