(136771, 6771, 3080, '<td valign="top">You''re photo was taken at a nice angle, however it''s quite busy near the bottom.  I don''t know how you could have done this to get your point across without it looking cluttered.   What stands out to me first is the yellow car.  It looks like it''s been lit by a different sourse, like a spot light or something.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'You''re photo was taken at a nice angle, however it''s quite busy near the bottom.  I don''t know how you could have done this to get your point across without it looking cluttered.   What stands out to me first is the yellow car.  It looks like it''s been lit by a different sourse, like a spot light or something.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
