(136787, 6773, 4100, '<td valign="top">Possibly the most original approach to the subject this week, and also a technically spot-on and aesthetically intriguing image that sticks in the mind. Very impressive...</td>', 'Possibly the most original approach to the subject this week, and also a technically spot-on and aesthetically intriguing image that sticks in the mind. Very impressive...', '2002-10-07 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
