(136802, 6773, 3080, '<td valign="top">Frozen in ice?  Pretty cool.  Really interesting method, and definately creative and requiring effort.   The flower is a nice touch too.  Excelent colors and your focus and clarity are quite good.  I love the idea behind this.  I also like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  You have taken the shot at a moment, with the ice partially melted, so that we can tell exactly what is going on.  Greta shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Frozen in ice?  Pretty cool.  Really interesting method, and definately creative and requiring effort.   The flower is a nice touch too.  Excelent colors and your focus and clarity are quite good.  I love the idea behind this.  I also like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  You have taken the shot at a moment, with the ice partially melted, so that we can tell exactly what is going on.  Greta shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136803, 6773, 3751, '<td valign="top">I reallylike this picture, great idea!!, nice lighting an focus, I don''t get the title though.</td>', 'I reallylike this picture, great idea!!, nice lighting an focus, I don''t get the title though.', '2002-10-09 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
