(136805, 6773, 1041, '<td valign="top">awesome.  i''m sure this is this week''s winner.  love your creativity, implementation and the message.  i''m curious how you did this ... it almost looks like you froze the candy wrappers or something.  i''m sure you''ll tell us on monday.  gr8photos (10).</td>', 'awesome.  i''m sure this is this week''s winner.  love your creativity, implementation and the message.  i''m curious how you did this ... it almost looks like you froze the candy wrappers or something.  i''m sure you''ll tell us on monday.  gr8photos (10).', '2002-10-10 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
