(136822, 6775, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great colors and content. The warmth in the colors of the brush contrast nicely with the dark sky and the abandoned crates. Wonderful photo!</td>', 'Great colors and content. The warmth in the colors of the brush contrast nicely with the dark sky and the abandoned crates. Wonderful photo!', '2002-10-07 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
