(136825, 6775, 2780, '<td valign="top">The way the plants have overgrown the boxes looks good, and the photo is composed well. Maybe adding a little more contrast to increase the mood that the sky sets would look good? Try it out :)<br/>- Konador</td>', 'The way the plants have overgrown the boxes looks good, and the photo is composed well. Maybe adding a little more contrast to increase the mood that the sky sets would look good? Try it out :)- Konador', '2002-10-10 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
