(136828, 6775, 3080, '<td valign="top">These look really nice in the surrounding bushes.  Pretty even.  I like this shot a lot.  How does it look in black and white?  I like the colors in this version though and your focus and clarity re great.  The angle that you have chosen is wonderful for this shot.  Lighting conditions seem perfect.  Great shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'These look really nice in the surrounding bushes.  Pretty even.  I like this shot a lot.  How does it look in black and white?  I like the colors in this version though and your focus and clarity re great.  The angle that you have chosen is wonderful for this shot.  Lighting conditions seem perfect.  Great shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136829, 6775, 245, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject, but there isn''t enough contrast in the scene... it looks pretty flat to me. This might be helped with a more obvious foreground/background to add depth, or shooting in the hard to find sweet spot where the boxes are lit by more sun but the sky still looks manacing!</td>', 'I really like the subject, but there isn''t enough contrast in the scene... it looks pretty flat to me. This might be helped with a more obvious foreground/background to add depth, or shooting in the hard to find sweet spot where the boxes are lit by more sun but the sky still looks manacing!', '2002-10-13 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136830, 6776, 3127, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. The colors are great, but a different background color may have created better contrast.  Still a very good photo.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. The colors are great, but a different background color may have created better contrast.  Still a very good photo.', '2002-10-07 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
