(136951, 6782, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think out of the apple core photos this week, this is one of my favorites.  Your lighting is good and the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen are also very nice.  The background works perfectly here.  I like how the red/white apple stands out on the blue background.  maybe that''s just the USA speaking up in me, but I like the colors a lot. :)  I like the fly, but he''s a little blurry, if you could have just asked him to stand still and look into the camera....lol just kidding.  Overall a really nice shot, one of my high scores this week. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I think out of the apple core photos this week, this is one of my favorites.  Your lighting is good and the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen are also very nice.  The background works perfectly here.  I like how the red/white apple stands out on the blue background.  maybe that''s just the USA speaking up in me, but I like the colors a lot. :)  I like the fly, but he''s a little blurry, if you could have just asked him to stand still and look into the camera....lol just kidding.  Overall a really nice shot, one of my high scores this week. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
