(137019, 6789, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-10-11 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137020, 6789, 4564, '<td valign="top">I see here a try to make the visual content interesting. There is clearly a try to make the framing original. Unfortunatly, there''s nothing there that makes this photo interesting to look at. Better luck next time.  Good effort.  Poor content. I give it a 2.</td>', 'I see here a try to make the visual content interesting. There is clearly a try to make the framing original. Unfortunatly, there''s nothing there that makes this photo interesting to look at. Better luck next time.  Good effort.  Poor content. I give it a 2.', '2002-10-12 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137021, 6791, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like the brick wall and the sunlight.  I think this shot begs to have the can more off center though.  Look at the shot in this challenge R2D2 and how the can off by itself came out so nice.  Good job.  DPz</td>', 'I really like the brick wall and the sunlight.  I think this shot begs to have the can more off center though.  Look at the shot in this challenge R2D2 and how the can off by itself came out so nice.  Good job.  DPz', '2002-10-07 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137022, 6791, 2764, '<td valign="top">Move it to the left and get it''s whole shadow</td>', 'Move it to the left and get it''s whole shadow', '2002-10-07 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137023, 6791, 772, '<td valign="top">Yup... it''s a trashcan...  The photo doesn''t say much else :) - setzler</td>', 'Yup... it''s a trashcan...  The photo doesn''t say much else :) - setzler', '2002-10-07 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137024, 6791, 4154, '<td valign="top">Your title says it all - but composition and lighting are poor</td>', 'Your title says it all - but composition and lighting are poor', '2002-10-07 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137025, 6791, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this simplistic idea a lot.  Had it been me, I may have tried moving the can further to the left to allow the full shadow in the shot, and eliminate the small diagonal shadow from the left.  Again, still a very good idea.</td>', 'Overall I like this simplistic idea a lot.  Had it been me, I may have tried moving the can further to the left to allow the full shadow in the shot, and eliminate the small diagonal shadow from the left.  Again, still a very good idea.', '2002-10-07 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137026, 6791, 3080, '<td valign="top">Yes it is.  It is a trash can, and nothing more.  I think this lacks something to make it exciting to me.  The wall seems too bright in the sun, and the shadow is distracting.  The top of the can is washed out.  The anlge and framing/cropping are good, and the focus on the can is also nice.  I like the use of neg. space, but kind of wish it were more interesting neg. space.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Yes it is.  It is a trash can, and nothing more.  I think this lacks something to make it exciting to me.  The wall seems too bright in the sun, and the shadow is distracting.  The top of the can is washed out.  The anlge and framing/cropping are good, and the focus on the can is also nice.  I like the use of neg. space, but kind of wish it were more interesting neg. space.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-08 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
