(137029, 6791, 3294, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a little too simple... not sure if I like the low and off centered subject either.  - bamaster (6)</td>', 'This photo seems a little too simple... not sure if I like the low and off centered subject either.  - bamaster (6)', '2002-10-10 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
