(137222, 6805, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the way the bright flowers stand out against the mass of green, and the white garbage does the same.  Good Photo.<br/>-Konador</td>', 'I like the way the bright flowers stand out against the mass of green, and the white garbage does the same.  Good Photo.-Konador', '2002-10-12 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137223, 6805, 1280, '<td valign="top">Hoooooray for nature!  I''m always rootin'' for nature.  Terrible how people dis'' the earth. Good photo Lisa!  I like photos with a message...lol...They aren''t always popular though.  But so what!  Grayce</td>', 'Hoooooray for nature!  I''m always rootin'' for nature.  Terrible how people dis'' the earth. Good photo Lisa!  I like photos with a message...lol...They aren''t always popular though.  But so what!  Grayce', '2002-10-14 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(137224, 6806, 4098, '<td valign="top">Well done, great tones and colours, it really feels trashy and dirty.</td>', 'Well done, great tones and colours, it really feels trashy and dirty.', '2002-10-07 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137225, 6806, 4077, '<td valign="top">Hmm... dig that funky chromatic aberation on the right hand ''hole''. (Just gotta love digital cameras.) Ace picture. seasick - 8</td>', 'Hmm... dig that funky chromatic aberation on the right hand ''hole''. (Just gotta love digital cameras.) Ace picture. seasick - 8', '2002-10-07 06:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137226, 6806, 4402, '<td valign="top">Very good use of lighting</td>', 'Very good use of lighting', '2002-10-07 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137227, 6806, 3317, '<td valign="top">very well composed. working with these light sources looks like it was tricky. would''ve like a tiny bit more detail on the right side glowing door, but i bet metering for that wouldve changed the look of the whole photograph.</td>', 'very well composed. working with these light sources looks like it was tricky. would''ve like a tiny bit more detail on the right side glowing door, but i bet metering for that wouldve changed the look of the whole photograph.', '2002-10-07 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137228, 6806, 2361, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully evocative.  One of my top 5 this week.  8 Jak</td>', 'Wonderfully evocative.  One of my top 5 this week.  8 Jak', '2002-10-07 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137229, 6806, 1779, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2002-10-07 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137230, 6806, 327, '<td valign="top">Really do like this...it''s working!!! Congrats. Good luck, Justine.</td>', 'Really do like this...it''s working!!! Congrats. Good luck, Justine.', '2002-10-07 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137231, 6806, 4426, '<td valign="top">If only that far door-way wasn''t so over-exposed.</td>', 'If only that far door-way wasn''t so over-exposed.', '2002-10-07 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137232, 6806, 3901, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, the negative-positive image... unfortunately, I feel that it is a picture of a tunnel and not a photo of garbage.</td>', 'I like the shot, the negative-positive image... unfortunately, I feel that it is a picture of a tunnel and not a photo of garbage.', '2002-10-07 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137233, 6806, 4365, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! The opposing images of the light wall and dark wall are very dramatic. The debris, espacially the child''s chair, really sets the mood.</td>', 'I love this photo! The opposing images of the light wall and dark wall are very dramatic. The debris, espacially the child''s chair, really sets the mood.', '2002-10-07 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137234, 6806, 3751, '<td valign="top">Nice place, too bad for the garbage</td>', 'Nice place, too bad for the garbage', '2002-10-07 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137235, 6806, 1143, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge. This is an awesome place. The lighting is interesting, but I would try it a little later in the day (with a tripod and slow shutter speed) so the one hole on the right isn''t so bright. Altho, this doesn''t look like the sort of place I would want to be too late in the evening  ;o)  Also, I think the chair (?) on the left is unnecessary. There is enough other garbage, and it distracts a little from the interesting lighting and lines of the shot.  8  ~indigo997</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge. This is an awesome place. The lighting is interesting, but I would try it a little later in the day (with a tripod and slow shutter speed) so the one hole on the right isn''t so bright. Altho, this doesn''t look like the sort of place I would want to be too late in the evening  ;o)  Also, I think the chair (?) on the left is unnecessary. There is enough other garbage, and it distracts a little from the interesting lighting and lines of the shot.  8  ~indigo997', '2002-10-07 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137236, 6806, 4388, '<td valign="top">great photo, should be titled "Lonely Places", not garbage</td>', 'great photo, should be titled "Lonely Places", not garbage', '2002-10-08 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137237, 6806, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very emotional shot.  Feels very sad and lonely.  Good color and eye on this one.  DPz</td>', 'Very emotional shot.  Feels very sad and lonely.  Good color and eye on this one.  DPz', '2002-10-08 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137238, 6806, 674, '<td valign="top"><br/>Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast.7<br/>Good composition.  5 yes and no it depends how you view it from the garbage point no from a moody photo point yes<br/>Tells a story or creates a mood 6<br/>      Impact to the viewer 7<br/>Relevance to the Challenge 6<br/>Overall 6<br/>sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast.7Good composition.  5 yes and no it depends how you view it from the garbage point no from a moody photo point yesTells a story or creates a mood 6      Impact to the viewer 7Relevance to the Challenge 6Overall 6sulamk', '2002-10-08 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137239, 6806, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like this composition. The chair is very important. Nice work! (8)</td>', 'I like this composition. The chair is very important. Nice work! (8)', '2002-10-08 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137240, 6806, 2527, '<td valign="top">Love the concept of your pic!<br/>Without been messy... gives you the scense of garbage!<br/>Good luck!<br/>Richi</td>', 'Love the concept of your pic!Without been messy... gives you the scense of garbage!Good luck!Richi', '2002-10-08 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137241, 6806, 2667, '<td valign="top">gorgeous texture on that wall!</td>', 'gorgeous texture on that wall!', '2002-10-08 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137242, 6806, 205, '<td valign="top">Where is this?</td>', 'Where is this?', '2002-10-08 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137243, 6806, 2480, '<td valign="top">Would have been a 10 picture if not for the chair/table thing in the foreground.</td>', 'Would have been a 10 picture if not for the chair/table thing in the foreground.', '2002-10-08 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137244, 6806, 3454, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, my only suggestion to be would to eliminate the chair, it draws my eye away from the really interesting area of the photo. Great work nontheless.</td>', 'Excellent shot, my only suggestion to be would to eliminate the chair, it draws my eye away from the really interesting area of the photo. Great work nontheless.', '2002-10-09 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137245, 6806, 3735, '<td valign="top">Most interesting   thank you</td>', 'Most interesting   thank you', '2002-10-09 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137246, 6806, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool place!  It is too bad for all the garbage there though.  But, I guess if there wasn''t garbage here, you couldn''t have submitted this shot.  The angle and framing are great.  I really like the way this curves like it does.  I think it is a bit dark in the foreground there, but it appears to be a not well lit place.  Overall a nice shot!  Great surroundings around your garbage. :) Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'This is a really cool place!  It is too bad for all the garbage there though.  But, I guess if there wasn''t garbage here, you couldn''t have submitted this shot.  The angle and framing are great.  I really like the way this curves like it does.  I think it is a bit dark in the foreground there, but it appears to be a not well lit place.  Overall a nice shot!  Great surroundings around your garbage. :) Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137247, 6806, 2928, '<td valign="top">Superb! The spooky feeling, the sense of atrophy, and the suspense in the shot are totally awesome, but the chair is a stoke of pure genius; I''d be interested to know if this was lit by fill flash or a natural light source. The scene has an air of ''What''s around the corner?'' that makes you want to pan around the bend.  The overall colour and dimly lit areas work to absolute perfection.  Superb photography. (10)</td>', 'Superb! The spooky feeling, the sense of atrophy, and the suspense in the shot are totally awesome, but the chair is a stoke of pure genius; I''d be interested to know if this was lit by fill flash or a natural light source. The scene has an air of ''What''s around the corner?'' that makes you want to pan around the bend.  The overall colour and dimly lit areas work to absolute perfection.  Superb photography. (10)', '2002-10-10 06:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137248, 6806, 4489, '<td valign="top">great natural lighting..</td>', 'great natural lighting..', '2002-10-11 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137249, 6806, 4162, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting and very atmospheric shot!  Really makes you feel like you are there!</td>', 'Fantastic lighting and very atmospheric shot!  Really makes you feel like you are there!', '2002-10-11 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137250, 6806, 4564, '<td valign="top">extremely nice framing and use of the lighting. 9</td>', 'extremely nice framing and use of the lighting. 9', '2002-10-12 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137251, 6806, 1019, '<td valign="top">Strong contrasts and the curved forms make this a powerful photo. The arches are quite beautiful and the textures are wonderful  andrewm</td>', 'Strong contrasts and the curved forms make this a powerful photo. The arches are quite beautiful and the textures are wonderful  andrewm', '2002-10-12 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
