(137253, 6806, 2978, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for you comments. This is my first submit and I''m very, very happy with it.<br/>About the chair: I took some shot and composed the frame w/o it but it lost its rhythm of lighting and balance to the bright window which is over exposed :P <br/>Glad I found this place</td>', 'Thank you all for you comments. This is my first submit and I''m very, very happy with it.About the chair: I took some shot and composed the frame w/o it but it lost its rhythm of lighting and balance to the bright window which is over exposed :P Glad I found this place', '2002-10-17 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(137254, 6807, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great image. Nice effort.</td>', 'Great image. Nice effort.', '2002-10-07 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137255, 6807, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but a bit too much white space.</td>', 'Great concept, but a bit too much white space.', '2002-10-07 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
