(137598, 6827, 4154, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who voted for my photo - I didn''t expect to finish this high up. For anyone who noticed that the label is upside down this is actually the kind of whisky bottle used behind bars, hanging upside down so the label reads the right way up then. It also helps that it is substantially bigger than a normal whisky bottle which helped with the composition.<br/><br/>Thanks again<br/><br/>Mike C.</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who voted for my photo - I didn''t expect to finish this high up. For anyone who noticed that the label is upside down this is actually the kind of whisky bottle used behind bars, hanging upside down so the label reads the right way up then. It also helps that it is substantially bigger than a normal whisky bottle which helped with the composition.Thanks againMike C.', '2002-10-14 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
