(137611, 6828, 3080, '<td valign="top">You either have horses, or a really really big cat.  Although this photo is full of crap, :) The angle and framing/cropping are good.  It is a well set up shot, and although it''s a photo of poo, It''s not discusting, and that''s a difficult task to achieve.  Focus and clarity are great.  I think I might have liked more light in the back corner though.  Just for added contrast.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'You either have horses, or a really really big cat.  Although this photo is full of crap, :) The angle and framing/cropping are good.  It is a well set up shot, and although it''s a photo of poo, It''s not discusting, and that''s a difficult task to achieve.  Focus and clarity are great.  I think I might have liked more light in the back corner though.  Just for added contrast.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-08 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
