(137623, 6829, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately garbage.  I think the focus is a bit soft for me though.  Looks almost like autofocus trying to focus on the wire instead of the garbage.  The colors are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  I like how this fills the entire photo.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Definately garbage.  I think the focus is a bit soft for me though.  Looks almost like autofocus trying to focus on the wire instead of the garbage.  The colors are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  I like how this fills the entire photo.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
