(137629, 6830, 3317, '<td valign="top">nice macro, thingie in the foregrounds a little distracting. hard to shoot a subject in the middle of a field, leaves a lot of dead space around the edges of the rectangle. find a cigarette butt in a corner, or near a curb, so there are more lines involved in the background.</td>', 'nice macro, thingie in the foregrounds a little distracting. hard to shoot a subject in the middle of a field, leaves a lot of dead space around the edges of the rectangle. find a cigarette butt in a corner, or near a curb, so there are more lines involved in the background.', '2002-10-07 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
