(137637, 6830, 3080, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered this with a bit more focus.  The butt stands out well on the background, and your framing/cropping are great.  Lighting cinditions are favorable for the shot.  Definately garbage, but  creativity is a little low.  Overall an average shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'I would have prefered this with a bit more focus.  The butt stands out well on the background, and your framing/cropping are great.  Lighting cinditions are favorable for the shot.  Definately garbage, but  creativity is a little low.  Overall an average shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
