(137650, 6831, 1009, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a picture, you might try using a higher apature setting to deepen your depth of field. That would make the image more focused overall, though your camera may not have manual controls. Excellent contest entry.</td>', 'Good idea for a picture, you might try using a higher apature setting to deepen your depth of field. That would make the image more focused overall, though your camera may not have manual controls. Excellent contest entry.', '2002-10-11 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
