(137657, 6832, 3080, '<td valign="top">Fortunately, your focus is so good, that I can read that on the green sign.  lol.  Nice clarity and detail shown here.  the angle is really nice, and you show a lot of garbage here without the photo being too cluttered or busy.  Lighting conditions were great.  Nice job of not taking the photo directly into the sun or something.  No distracting bright spots, or shadows.   Really nice. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Fortunately, your focus is so good, that I can read that on the green sign.  lol.  Nice clarity and detail shown here.  the angle is really nice, and you show a lot of garbage here without the photo being too cluttered or busy.  Lighting conditions were great.  Nice job of not taking the photo directly into the sun or something.  No distracting bright spots, or shadows.   Really nice. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
