(137659, 6833, 4098, '<td valign="top">A better background would have made those tea bags stand out a little better...</td>', 'A better background would have made those tea bags stand out a little better...', '2002-10-07 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137660, 6833, 3859, '<td valign="top">If these items were on a lighter background I think it would have worked much better.</td>', 'If these items were on a lighter background I think it would have worked much better.', '2002-10-07 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137661, 6833, 2261, '<td valign="top">Well, where do we start? Try not to put your subject in the centre of your picture if the negative space around it is not too interesting as it isn''t in this picture.<br/>The image could be alot sharper, try using un-sharp mask in photoshop, or whichever software you have. <br/>I like the lone teabag, it seems to be saying "get me away from these rotting things!"<br/>The top left is a tad dark but this is only minor. Overall a good first attempt but you can improve just by thinking through your shot before you take it. 8-Martin</td>', 'Well, where do we start? Try not to put your subject in the centre of your picture if the negative space around it is not too interesting as it isn''t in this picture.The image could be alot sharper, try using un-sharp mask in photoshop, or whichever software you have. I like the lone teabag, it seems to be saying "get me away from these rotting things!"The top left is a tad dark but this is only minor. Overall a good first attempt but you can improve just by thinking through your shot before you take it. 8-Martin', '2002-10-07 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137662, 6833, 4005, '<td valign="top">What''s the green thing? For me it looks like an avocado?!? Doesn''t fit into this scenery - in my eyes it would have looked better without! Maybe instead a teacup? Don''t know...</td>', 'What''s the green thing? For me it looks like an avocado?!? Doesn''t fit into this scenery - in my eyes it would have looked better without! Maybe instead a teacup? Don''t know...', '2002-10-07 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137663, 6833, 3900, '<td valign="top">Is that an avocado?  That is truely a waste... my favorite food.  I''m not sure how they go together, but it''s interesting.</td>', 'Is that an avocado?  That is truely a waste... my favorite food.  I''m not sure how they go together, but it''s interesting.', '2002-10-08 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
