(137763, 6838, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met - yes<br/>technical - picture seems blurred, trash in the open bag is overexposed<br/>composition - i realize you probably had to take that shot pretty quick while the situation was there, but a lower angle from further to the right might have been more effective (if possible) so that the dog''s face was more visible (and didn''t melt into the trash as much).  i also have a preference of animal/kid pictures that are taken at their level rather than looking down on them.<br/>gr8photos</td>', 'challenge met - yestechnical - picture seems blurred, trash in the open bag is overexposedcomposition - i realize you probably had to take that shot pretty quick while the situation was there, but a lower angle from further to the right might have been more effective (if possible) so that the dog''s face was more visible (and didn''t melt into the trash as much).  i also have a preference of animal/kid pictures that are taken at their level rather than looking down on them.gr8photos', '2002-10-10 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137764, 6838, 2261, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. The overexposure is probably a result of your flash which would not be needed in this type of shot. My only criticism is the dog is very ugly and looks like he may well stink! 8-Martin</td>', 'Very nice composition. The overexposure is probably a result of your flash which would not be needed in this type of shot. My only criticism is the dog is very ugly and looks like he may well stink! 8-Martin', '2002-10-11 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
