(137825, 6842, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excelent focus.  I can read the labels!  I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  It looks very nice with the bottles filling the entire photo as it does.  I think you have done an excelent job of keeping terrible glare and reflection off the glass.  You have kept it minimal.  The colors are nice together, and the wetness of the bottles adds a nice touch.  Overall a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Excelent focus.  I can read the labels!  I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  It looks very nice with the bottles filling the entire photo as it does.  I think you have done an excelent job of keeping terrible glare and reflection off the glass.  You have kept it minimal.  The colors are nice together, and the wetness of the bottles adds a nice touch.  Overall a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
