(138021, 6862, 4534, '<td valign="top">Color would be better</td>', 'Color would be better', '2002-10-10 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(138022, 6862, 2221, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. I like how all the trashed cars are stacked up. The lighting looks a bit shallow and boring. I don''t know the original image but you probably chose black&amp;white for a reason. However, it only makes it look more flat in this case. Maybe a different angle? Maybe from a little below to show how tall this stack is? Just an idea. Also to me the photo looks a bit unsharp. Maybe a little postprocessing (sharpening is allowed) could have helped that. -stephan</td>', 'Interesting subject. I like how all the trashed cars are stacked up. The lighting looks a bit shallow and boring. I don''t know the original image but you probably chose black&white for a reason. However, it only makes it look more flat in this case. Maybe a different angle? Maybe from a little below to show how tall this stack is? Just an idea. Also to me the photo looks a bit unsharp. Maybe a little postprocessing (sharpening is allowed) could have helped that. -stephan', '2002-10-13 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
