(138183, 6875, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pretty scenery, and you included some garbage too.  Subtle, but obvious.  you have done a good job of making a photo of garbage look nicely presentable.  focus and clarity are good.  I like the angle you have chosen here, with the garbage in the bottom right, and looking down the river.  Looks like there''s some other garbage down farther, but I think that with it not being "jump out at you" obvious, that the garbage in the bottom right works just fine.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Pretty scenery, and you included some garbage too.  Subtle, but obvious.  you have done a good job of making a photo of garbage look nicely presentable.  focus and clarity are good.  I like the angle you have chosen here, with the garbage in the bottom right, and looking down the river.  Looks like there''s some other garbage down farther, but I think that with it not being "jump out at you" obvious, that the garbage in the bottom right works just fine.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
