(138217, 6876, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  He does look like r2d2 doesn''t he.  seems to be doing his job too cause there is no trash to be see.  The photo is definately garbage related though, so that counts too.  Angle and framing/cropping are great.  I like the foggy, overcast look in the background, kind of gives it atmosphere.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very nice.  He does look like r2d2 doesn''t he.  seems to be doing his job too cause there is no trash to be see.  The photo is definately garbage related though, so that counts too.  Angle and framing/cropping are great.  I like the foggy, overcast look in the background, kind of gives it atmosphere.  Great shot.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
