(138219, 6877, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice color.  I took a similar shot this week without the dozer.  I found it was so hard to make the trash seem even a bit in focus.  It ends up as a big blob of color. I like the composition, it all points to the trash.  DPz</td>', 'Nice color.  I took a similar shot this week without the dozer.  I found it was so hard to make the trash seem even a bit in focus.  It ends up as a big blob of color. I like the composition, it all points to the trash.  DPz', '2002-10-07 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
