(138226, 6877, 3080, '<td valign="top">And a whole lot of garbage it is.  I know that there are photo size requirements, but this would have been a lot better shot without the really blown out sky.  Maybe a horizontal shot would have been able to capture the garbage and cut out the sky.  It even would look good without the trees if need be.  The focus on the garbage is good, and the lighting on the subject its self is nice.  Overall a desent shot of garbage. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'And a whole lot of garbage it is.  I know that there are photo size requirements, but this would have been a lot better shot without the really blown out sky.  Maybe a horizontal shot would have been able to capture the garbage and cut out the sky.  It even would look good without the trees if need be.  The focus on the garbage is good, and the lighting on the subject its self is nice.  Overall a desent shot of garbage. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
