(138419, 6891, 2337, '<td valign="top">LoL!!! As someone that lived through that, it''s only funny now :)  Not sure how many folks will get this.  Technically could have had sharper focus.</td>', 'LoL!!! As someone that lived through that, it''s only funny now :)  Not sure how many folks will get this.  Technically could have had sharper focus.', '2002-10-07 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
