(138421, 6891, 3380, '<td valign="top">Very well thought out. It definitely gives an impact. However, there is a noticable resolution it. The image appears someahwt pixelated. Perhaps less compression.</td>', 'Very well thought out. It definitely gives an impact. However, there is a noticable resolution it. The image appears someahwt pixelated. Perhaps less compression.', '2002-10-07 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
