(138436, 6891, 4577, '<td valign="top">CHEDDER</td>', 'CHEDDER', '2002-10-13 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(138437, 6891, 1696, '<td valign="top">Willa, der.<br/><br/>A garbage slick nearly a mile long along the shorein Ocean County, New Jersey, on May 23, 1988, marked the first slick of the season. Needles,syringes, and empty prescription bottles withNew York addresses washed upon the shore (31).New Jersey beaches closed several times last sea-son due to such incidents. More recently, on July6-7, 1988, 10 miles of Long Island beaches closedwhen medical wastes washed ashore. Through-out the summer of 1988, beaches from Maineto the Gulf of Mexico, along the Great Lakes,and elsewhere in the Nation experienced washupsof medical wastes.</td>', 'Willa, der.A garbage slick nearly a mile long along the shorein Ocean County, New Jersey, on May 23, 1988, marked the first slick of the season. Needles,syringes, and empty prescription bottles withNew York addresses washed upon the shore (31).New Jersey beaches closed several times last sea-son due to such incidents. More recently, on July6-7, 1988, 10 miles of Long Island beaches closedwhen medical wastes washed ashore. Through-out the summer of 1988, beaches from Maineto the Gulf of Mexico, along the Great Lakes,and elsewhere in the Nation experienced washupsof medical wastes.', '2002-10-14 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(138438, 6892, 4079, '<td valign="top">Nice picture! I really like how it is in black and white, it gives the picture a powerful emotion. Also, I really like how it is rusted and cerroded.  Score...10</td>', 'Nice picture! I really like how it is in black and white, it gives the picture a powerful emotion. Also, I really like how it is rusted and cerroded.  Score...10', '2002-10-07 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
