(138468, 6894, 332, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like it when people get close to their subject!. -arnit</td>', 'Good shot. I like it when people get close to their subject!. -arnit', '2002-10-11 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(138469, 6894, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like the crayons when my 2 year old is done with them.  I have tried to photograph crayola crayons, and found it very difficult because the wrappers are textured and look grainy when shot.  Other than the fact that the blue crayon is perfectly new, the shot is flawless.  I''m not counting down cause of the new crayon, it''s just a strange observation.  Your focus and clarity on the wrappers is excelent.  we can see the fibers. I like the DOF, and the angle and framing/cropping are also great.  very nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Looks like the crayons when my 2 year old is done with them.  I have tried to photograph crayola crayons, and found it very difficult because the wrappers are textured and look grainy when shot.  Other than the fact that the blue crayon is perfectly new, the shot is flawless.  I''m not counting down cause of the new crayon, it''s just a strange observation.  Your focus and clarity on the wrappers is excelent.  we can see the fibers. I like the DOF, and the angle and framing/cropping are also great.  very nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
