(138492, 6895, 3080, '<td valign="top">At first this confused me, but then I realized that it looks like we are looking into the cup through the bottom, like we are inside the cup.  That is pretty cool.  Interesting way to do this.  The perspective is really nice.  I think that the focus and clarity could be better, but then again, I don''t know the difficulty in taking a shot like this.  Overall nice shot of garbage that isn''t discusting. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'At first this confused me, but then I realized that it looks like we are looking into the cup through the bottom, like we are inside the cup.  That is pretty cool.  Interesting way to do this.  The perspective is really nice.  I think that the focus and clarity could be better, but then again, I don''t know the difficulty in taking a shot like this.  Overall nice shot of garbage that isn''t discusting. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
