(138533, 6897, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your garbage can is crooked.  I know...you''re thinking. "is that all she has to say?  what a stupid comment".  But it is the first thing that stood out to me.  Then the really cool effect with the can.  Must have been a pain in the neck to shoot that to get it right.  So see, that is the only thing I really have to complain about.  The garbage can is crooked.  Technically well done, although lacking in overall excitement...it''s garbage.  You did what you needed to do, and that is that.  And did I mention cool effect with the can.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Your garbage can is crooked.  I know...you''re thinking. "is that all she has to say?  what a stupid comment".  But it is the first thing that stood out to me.  Then the really cool effect with the can.  Must have been a pain in the neck to shoot that to get it right.  So see, that is the only thing I really have to complain about.  The garbage can is crooked.  Technically well done, although lacking in overall excitement...it''s garbage.  You did what you needed to do, and that is that.  And did I mention cool effect with the can.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
