(138550, 6897, 3102, '<td valign="top">First, I''d like to thank the Academy... (oops!  Wrong acceptance speech!)<br/><br/>Seriously, I''m thrilled to have the top shot of the week -- how exciting!!  Thanks to everyone who left some really good comments on how I could have improved this further.  I really like the idea of using a nice steel can as a couple people had suggested, and John is right about the fact that the can itself is a little brighter than it should be in spots.<br/><br/>This was a lot of fun (and work!) to put together, and I''ve learned quite a bit from the experience of doing this shot, as well as from the comments it received.<br/><br/>Since some folks had asked for a more detailed description of how this was executed, I put a page together to describe it in more detail:  //www.thefreeds.com/swish<br/><br/>Again, many thanks to all!<br/></td>', 'First, I''d like to thank the Academy... (oops!  Wrong acceptance speech!)Seriously, I''m thrilled to have the top shot of the week -- how exciting!!  Thanks to everyone who left some really good comments on how I could have improved this further.  I really like the idea of using a nice steel can as a couple people had suggested, and John is right about the fact that the can itself is a little brighter than it should be in spots.This was a lot of fun (and work!) to put together, and I''ve learned quite a bit from the experience of doing this shot, as well as from the comments it received.Since some folks had asked for a more detailed description of how this was executed, I put a page together to describe it in more detail:  //www.thefreeds.com/swishAgain, many thanks to all!', '2002-10-14 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
