(138579, 6899, 3859, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but I think this "garbage" is too neat and clean for the picture to come across like I think you planned it to.  A better choice in these beautiful red flowers, IMO, would be some really dirty, trashy, looking garbage. Then the contrast between the ugly garbage and beautiful location would be much more dramatic.  6</td>', 'I like your idea, but I think this "garbage" is too neat and clean for the picture to come across like I think you planned it to.  A better choice in these beautiful red flowers, IMO, would be some really dirty, trashy, looking garbage. Then the contrast between the ugly garbage and beautiful location would be much more dramatic.  6', '2002-10-07 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
