(138587, 6899, 3317, '<td valign="top">sorry, i''m a bigot, i vote lower if a shot looks like it was set up. one bottle in the flowers is believable; five of them conjures the image of you in your yard arranging your trash just so, kinda spoils it for me. p.s.- if you''re outside and it''s daytime, how about some sunlight.</td>', 'sorry, i''m a bigot, i vote lower if a shot looks like it was set up. one bottle in the flowers is believable; five of them conjures the image of you in your yard arranging your trash just so, kinda spoils it for me. p.s.- if you''re outside and it''s daytime, how about some sunlight.', '2002-10-10 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
