(138590, 6899, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m sitting here wondering how you managed to get the garbage in focus and the flowers so out of focus.  It seems to me that these flowers might be a kind that is just hard to capture properly?  Because the bush in the back is also in focus.  Your angle and framing are good, and the lighting conditions are quite nice for the shot.  Overall a nice photo. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I''m sitting here wondering how you managed to get the garbage in focus and the flowers so out of focus.  It seems to me that these flowers might be a kind that is just hard to capture properly?  Because the bush in the back is also in focus.  Your angle and framing are good, and the lighting conditions are quite nice for the shot.  Overall a nice photo. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-11 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
