(138604, 6900, 2928, '<td valign="top">Unusual concept, but it is valid. This is a great use of negative space, DOF and colour.  The composition has a cold, grey feel that heralds the onset of winter. The golden red colour of the leaves compliments the overall image to good effect. The more one looks, the more one is drawn to the sense of movement within the image and a feeling of inevitable decay.  I''d guess this wasn''t an easy shot to get right, but your technique has served you well. Great photography. (10)</td>', 'Unusual concept, but it is valid. This is a great use of negative space, DOF and colour.  The composition has a cold, grey feel that heralds the onset of winter. The golden red colour of the leaves compliments the overall image to good effect. The more one looks, the more one is drawn to the sense of movement within the image and a feeling of inevitable decay.  I''d guess this wasn''t an easy shot to get right, but your technique has served you well. Great photography. (10)', '2002-10-09 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
