(138622, 6901, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  Definately creative and original.  I really like the purple glow here.  Your angle and framing/cropping are also quite nice.  There is something about the light source though.  I think I wish that it weren''t quite so obvious of the light source, maybe have it just be glowing without the obvious location of the light.  I''m not sure how you would do that, or if it would even be possible, but it might be something to try.  Overall a really neat shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Pretty cool.  Definately creative and original.  I really like the purple glow here.  Your angle and framing/cropping are also quite nice.  There is something about the light source though.  I think I wish that it weren''t quite so obvious of the light source, maybe have it just be glowing without the obvious location of the light.  I''m not sure how you would do that, or if it would even be possible, but it might be something to try.  Overall a really neat shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-11 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
