(138696, 6905, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your angle and framing are very nice here.  I like the kind of stop motion of the water.  I can see the coffee going right down the drain.  Not the typical garbage photo, which is nice.  Lighting is good, with the exception of one bright spot on the sink in the upper left, but i''ve photographed sinks, and well...they do that. lol.  Overall a very nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Your angle and framing are very nice here.  I like the kind of stop motion of the water.  I can see the coffee going right down the drain.  Not the typical garbage photo, which is nice.  Lighting is good, with the exception of one bright spot on the sink in the upper left, but i''ve photographed sinks, and well...they do that. lol.  Overall a very nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
