(138741, 6908, 2003, '<td valign="top">went down to the downtown/"artist" section of Santa Ana (one of the more ethnic (read "poorer" areas in Orange County)) expecting to see more than the usual amounts of trash - found this in the 1st crosswalk i came to after i parked - liked the whole black/white/red contrast --- i agree that it would probably look better without the leaves and gravel, but i wasn''t going to pick through the trash just to get the ''proper'' trash for the shot :)</td>', 'went down to the downtown/"artist" section of Santa Ana (one of the more ethnic (read "poorer" areas in Orange County)) expecting to see more than the usual amounts of trash - found this in the 1st crosswalk i came to after i parked - liked the whole black/white/red contrast --- i agree that it would probably look better without the leaves and gravel, but i wasn''t going to pick through the trash just to get the ''proper'' trash for the shot :)', '2002-11-07 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
