(138747, 6909, 3080, '<td valign="top">Yeah really, no need for those signs anymore.  Definately garbage.  Your angle and framing/cropping are nice.  Focus is great. and the lighting looks very nice.  if you get complaints about the shadow from the wood structure, I''ll just say that I like the structure there, because it makes it look like these signs were thrown behind something to get rid of the and hide them, not just that they were set down somewhere.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Yeah really, no need for those signs anymore.  Definately garbage.  Your angle and framing/cropping are nice.  Focus is great. and the lighting looks very nice.  if you get complaints about the shadow from the wood structure, I''ll just say that I like the structure there, because it makes it look like these signs were thrown behind something to get rid of the and hide them, not just that they were set down somewhere.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
