(138754, 6910, 1696, '<td valign="top">Okay, here''s the thing. We did the same picture. And I know from looking at this picture and how it is staged, that these are new, and not trash. Because I had my head in a bio bucket all week filled with HIV+ bloody needles, and I know you could not have gotten the lighting this good without touching them. And I know that someone with access to medical supplies would not touch dirty needles. Right? But I''m not marking you down for that, just calling you a cheater because you got way better lighting than me. ;) Good idea though! I''m giving you an 8, I think.</td>', 'Okay, here''s the thing. We did the same picture. And I know from looking at this picture and how it is staged, that these are new, and not trash. Because I had my head in a bio bucket all week filled with HIV+ bloody needles, and I know you could not have gotten the lighting this good without touching them. And I know that someone with access to medical supplies would not touch dirty needles. Right? But I''m not marking you down for that, just calling you a cheater because you got way better lighting than me. ;) Good idea though! I''m giving you an 8, I think.', '2002-10-07 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
