(138757, 6910, 3932, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me cringe!  I hate needles :)  I like how the needle is positioned so that you can see the text "Use Once And Destroy."  I don''t know if you arranged these at all, but the orange caps seem concentrated on the right portion of the shot, while the subject "use once and destroy" doesn''t draw a lot of attention by itself at the bottom... but I guess at the same time, when you see the one at the bottom, you see the "subject also."?  -   JB</td>', 'This shot makes me cringe!  I hate needles :)  I like how the needle is positioned so that you can see the text "Use Once And Destroy."  I don''t know if you arranged these at all, but the orange caps seem concentrated on the right portion of the shot, while the subject "use once and destroy" doesn''t draw a lot of attention by itself at the bottom... but I guess at the same time, when you see the one at the bottom, you see the "subject also."?  -   JB', '2002-10-10 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
