(138797, 6912, 3080, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, and funnier title.  I think this is a really great concept.  The tones are nice, but I think it''s a bit dark for my taste.  The sky is beautiful, but the front of the ski is dark and loses detail, also the top of the ski blends in with trees a bit.  Overall a nice depiction of garbage.  Not the typical gross "trash can" kind of garbage. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Funny shot, and funnier title.  I think this is a really great concept.  The tones are nice, but I think it''s a bit dark for my taste.  The sky is beautiful, but the front of the ski is dark and loses detail, also the top of the ski blends in with trees a bit.  Overall a nice depiction of garbage.  Not the typical gross "trash can" kind of garbage. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(138798, 6912, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the title, its funny :) As for the photo, well, I think it''s a bit dark unfortunatly, because otherwise, it''s a nicely composed and interesting photo. - Konador</td>', 'I like the title, its funny :) As for the photo, well, I think it''s a bit dark unfortunatly, because otherwise, it''s a nicely composed and interesting photo. - Konador', '2002-10-10 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
