(138807, 6913, 3080, '<td valign="top">MMmmmm, Stinky shoes and KFC.  You have centered the can in the shot very nicely, nice framing/cropping.  This is definately garbage, I''ll give it that.  lighting is good, no distracting shadows or bright spots.  overall an average shot.  while technically well done, nothing here makes me scream "oh wow...amazing!".  I know, it''s hard to do with garbage, so I''ll meet you a bit better than half way with score.  I think that''s fair. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'MMmmmm, Stinky shoes and KFC.  You have centered the can in the shot very nicely, nice framing/cropping.  This is definately garbage, I''ll give it that.  lighting is good, no distracting shadows or bright spots.  overall an average shot.  while technically well done, nothing here makes me scream "oh wow...amazing!".  I know, it''s hard to do with garbage, so I''ll meet you a bit better than half way with score.  I think that''s fair. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-12 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
