(138818, 6914, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very clean shot of garbage.  Not gross or discusting.  I''m not too fond of the light glares on the cans, but it''s not bad.  the background is strange.  I can''t figure out if it''s a cloth, or sand.  Strange looking background.  Overall though, the focus and clarity are nice and I also like how you have filled the whole photo with the subject.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'A very clean shot of garbage.  Not gross or discusting.  I''m not too fond of the light glares on the cans, but it''s not bad.  the background is strange.  I can''t figure out if it''s a cloth, or sand.  Strange looking background.  Overall though, the focus and clarity are nice and I also like how you have filled the whole photo with the subject.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1);
