(139023, 6926, 3900, '<td valign="top">...and waiting, and waiting, and waiting.  We are all waiting (at least the 31 people who gave you a 10) to hear at least a hint as to how you did this.  I realize you don''t have to.  Maybe you''re waiting to use the same technique again and don''t want to give it away.  That''s fine, but any word, just a word from you about it, would be commonly courteous.  Frankly, I''m just tired of checking back here to find nothing.  Hello?</td>', '...and waiting, and waiting, and waiting.  We are all waiting (at least the 31 people who gave you a 10) to hear at least a hint as to how you did this.  I realize you don''t have to.  Maybe you''re waiting to use the same technique again and don''t want to give it away.  That''s fine, but any word, just a word from you about it, would be commonly courteous.  Frankly, I''m just tired of checking back here to find nothing.  Hello?', '2002-10-26 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
