(139025, 6927, 2337, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Been there, done that... Very interesting and unique view of the challenge.  Technically appealing as well... Great job!  The blur on the hammer is almost too much to identify it.  You may have done better with a tad less motion.  But that''s just my opinion...</td>', 'Ouch!  Been there, done that... Very interesting and unique view of the challenge.  Technically appealing as well... Great job!  The blur on the hammer is almost too much to identify it.  You may have done better with a tad less motion.  But that''s just my opinion...', '2002-10-07 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
