(139036, 6927, 3080, '<td valign="top">With the blurr almost completely erasing the handle, I almost didn''t recognize this as a hammer, but i see it now, and this is a great representational photo.  I was thinking "Don''t hit it" but realized that it was on a couch or something, so if you DID hit it, it wouldn''t hurt it too bad, if at all.  I think this is a great shot, the angle and framing/cropping are nice.  The focus and clarity are also great.  I love the pattern in the ring.  Lighting is nice for the shot.  My only nit pick is that I wish the handle weren''t so "invisible" due to the motion.  Overall nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'With the blurr almost completely erasing the handle, I almost didn''t recognize this as a hammer, but i see it now, and this is a great representational photo.  I was thinking "Don''t hit it" but realized that it was on a couch or something, so if you DID hit it, it wouldn''t hurt it too bad, if at all.  I think this is a great shot, the angle and framing/cropping are nice.  The focus and clarity are also great.  I love the pattern in the ring.  Lighting is nice for the shot.  My only nit pick is that I wish the handle weren''t so "invisible" due to the motion.  Overall nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-10 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139037, 6927, 4564, '<td valign="top">Nice textures. Nice framing. Nice focal lenght. A bit uninteresting, but... very nice effort. 7/10</td>', 'Nice textures. Nice framing. Nice focal lenght. A bit uninteresting, but... very nice effort. 7/10', '2002-10-12 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
