(139057, 6928, 1037, '<td valign="top">All the elements in this photo gel really well for me. I just LOVE rubble :). I volunteered on some archaeology digs when I was a student, and carrying around buckets of dirt, pulling up the foundations of old houses, etc. was so much fun. Scenes like this give me a real sense of history and make me wonder at the stories this building could tell. 10 - lisae</td>', 'All the elements in this photo gel really well for me. I just LOVE rubble :). I volunteered on some archaeology digs when I was a student, and carrying around buckets of dirt, pulling up the foundations of old houses, etc. was so much fun. Scenes like this give me a real sense of history and make me wonder at the stories this building could tell. 10 - lisae', '2002-10-13 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
