(139078, 6930, 3080, '<td valign="top">We have cucumber fields here and you see piles of cucumbers on the side of the road for anyone to take.  I like this kind of "garbage".  You have shot this nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  There is a light glare on the large gourd in the bottom right corner, but that''s not big deal.  Focus and clarity are great.  I like how you can see different patterns on the gourds.  Really nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'We have cucumber fields here and you see piles of cucumbers on the side of the road for anyone to take.  I like this kind of "garbage".  You have shot this nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  There is a light glare on the large gourd in the bottom right corner, but that''s not big deal.  Focus and clarity are great.  I like how you can see different patterns on the gourds.  Really nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
