(135750, 6684, 3672, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the encouraging words. I really appreciate it! This is a chihuahua. She''s about 4lbs maybe 6 in" tall by maybe a foot long. She''s a show breed, so smaller than most chihuahuas. The angle of the camer is about a foot and a half to two feet from the ground. I received some comments on how clean the trash was. This is an actual trash can next to my computer. Its where all my printed trash goes, along with my dryer sheets from laundy.  My dog loves those laundry fabric softner sheets and its what she was after.</td>', 'Thanks for the encouraging words. I really appreciate it! This is a chihuahua. She''s about 4lbs maybe 6 in" tall by maybe a foot long. She''s a show breed, so smaller than most chihuahuas. The angle of the camer is about a foot and a half to two feet from the ground. I received some comments on how clean the trash was. This is an actual trash can next to my computer. Its where all my printed trash goes, along with my dryer sheets from laundy.  My dog loves those laundry fabric softner sheets and its what she was after.', '2002-10-15 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
