(135810, 6693, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus!  The detail in the brick amazes me.  And I can read their phone number. lol.  Definately garbage, but it looks almost glorified somehow.  I think it''s the lighting.  It''s warm tones and the light refecting in the corner of the garbage dumpster.  Looks brand new.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Wonderful focus!  The detail in the brick amazes me.  And I can read their phone number. lol.  Definately garbage, but it looks almost glorified somehow.  I think it''s the lighting.  It''s warm tones and the light refecting in the corner of the garbage dumpster.  Looks brand new.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
