(136002, 6710, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''d be going the other way.  Although I do see your point, I''m not sure exactly what the hurricane is trashing, looks pretty much just like a storm to me.  I don''t see any trash, and I don''t really see anything being trashed.  I think that the angle is distracting, having such a right tilt.  The water drops make parts of the photo seem out of focus.  Don''t mean to be picky here, just telling you what I see.  Great documentary shot though. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I''d be going the other way.  Although I do see your point, I''m not sure exactly what the hurricane is trashing, looks pretty much just like a storm to me.  I don''t see any trash, and I don''t really see anything being trashed.  I think that the angle is distracting, having such a right tilt.  The water drops make parts of the photo seem out of focus.  Don''t mean to be picky here, just telling you what I see.  Great documentary shot though. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
