(136272, 6735, 2337, '<td valign="top">Most moving, thought provoking photo of this or any challenge I''ve been in... And it''s technically excellent to boot!!! This is a solid 10.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Most moving, thought provoking photo of this or any challenge I''ve been in... And it''s technically excellent to boot!!! This is a solid 10.  Congratulations.', '2002-10-07 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136273, 6735, 1143, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. It is by far my favorite of the challenge. Your DOF is awesome. I''m amazed that you caught the girl in such great focus. Her dress makes your eyes go straight to her, but the color in the boxes on the right helps move your eye across the pic. My only suggestion would have been to move whatever is in the extreme foreground and created those very blurry blobs along the bottom of the shot.  10  ~indigo997</td>', 'I love this shot. It is by far my favorite of the challenge. Your DOF is awesome. I''m amazed that you caught the girl in such great focus. Her dress makes your eyes go straight to her, but the color in the boxes on the right helps move your eye across the pic. My only suggestion would have been to move whatever is in the extreme foreground and created those very blurry blobs along the bottom of the shot.  10  ~indigo997', '2002-10-07 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
