(136285, 6735, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m failing to see the pizza part of this photo.  There is definately garbage in the shot.  The main focus to me seems the child, as the child is really the only thing in focus.  The lighting is good for this shot though.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  My only complaint is the focus, and the blurry spot near the bottom right corner.  Overall a nice mood though. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'I guess I''m failing to see the pizza part of this photo.  There is definately garbage in the shot.  The main focus to me seems the child, as the child is really the only thing in focus.  The lighting is good for this shot though.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  My only complaint is the focus, and the blurry spot near the bottom right corner.  Overall a nice mood though. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
