(136288, 6735, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is just an awesome piece of photography The captured backward glance is a masterstroke of pure genius, DOF is just superb, composition is outstanding  need I go on  (10)</td>', 'This is just an awesome piece of photography The captured backward glance is a masterstroke of pure genius, DOF is just superb, composition is outstanding  need I go on  (10)', '2002-10-10 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136289, 6735, 2923, '<td valign="top">nice. 10</td>', 'nice. 10', '2002-10-10 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136290, 6735, 3859, '<td valign="top">I saved this photo for last, as I couldn''t quite make up my mind what I thought about it. Not that I didn''t like it.  It is mesmerizing, in fact. That face!  Those eyes! That red dress and earrings! But I kept feeling like she was the object of the photo instead of the garbage. She is more in focus than the trash.  But yet, the trash is there. And as well executed as some of these garbage photos are, none has evoked emotions like this one.  The more I look at it, and those eyes look at me, I think this is not only an excellent photo for the challenge, but one of the few that I would ever even want to look at again.  This is my only 10 this week.</td>', 'I saved this photo for last, as I couldn''t quite make up my mind what I thought about it. Not that I didn''t like it.  It is mesmerizing, in fact. That face!  Those eyes! That red dress and earrings! But I kept feeling like she was the object of the photo instead of the garbage. She is more in focus than the trash.  But yet, the trash is there. And as well executed as some of these garbage photos are, none has evoked emotions like this one.  The more I look at it, and those eyes look at me, I think this is not only an excellent photo for the challenge, but one of the few that I would ever even want to look at again.  This is my only 10 this week.', '2002-10-11 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
