(136296, 6735, 1037, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is honestly one of the best photos I''ve ever seen on this site! 10 - lisae<br/><br/>Hmm... I should elaborate, it was quite late at night here when I wrote that, and I''d been drinking some scotch :). I love your use of depth of field and framing around the little girl to make her such a strong focal point. Her wide-eyed little urchin expression is so universal and intense, in the midst of what is obviously some crushing poverty. This is the kind of photo that makes me wish I could change the world. That''s a huge achievement.</td>', 'WOW! This is honestly one of the best photos I''ve ever seen on this site! 10 - lisaeHmm... I should elaborate, it was quite late at night here when I wrote that, and I''d been drinking some scotch :). I love your use of depth of field and framing around the little girl to make her such a strong focal point. Her wide-eyed little urchin expression is so universal and intense, in the midst of what is obviously some crushing poverty. This is the kind of photo that makes me wish I could change the world. That''s a huge achievement.', '2002-10-13 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(136297, 6735, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow! This seems to be the perfect photo to me. It has a very photo-journalistc feel and is very touching. I really would like to know more about the circumstances of this photo. Great work! -stephan</td>', 'Wow! This seems to be the perfect photo to me. It has a very photo-journalistc feel and is very touching. I really would like to know more about the circumstances of this photo. Great work! -stephan', '2002-10-13 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
