(136302, 6735, 2110, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for encouraging!<br/>I waited for about two hours for the girl to turn back and give a good smile. She was not aware that I was taking her photograph. This is taken at 300mm, so i was quite far. <br/><br/>I had limited freedom to move about and take the shot as I did not want to disturb the suroundings , and specailly the girl child.  It was good fun...waiting to get a good shot!<br/></td>', 'Thanks to all for encouraging!I waited for about two hours for the girl to turn back and give a good smile. She was not aware that I was taking her photograph. This is taken at 300mm, so i was quite far. I had limited freedom to move about and take the shot as I did not want to disturb the suroundings , and specailly the girl child.  It was good fun...waiting to get a good shot!', '2002-10-14 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
