(136366, 6740, 811, '<td valign="top">Okay, I am assuming that you are saying the Bible, or the book of Isaiah, is garbage.  If i had my Bible handy, or if I could read the page, I would look to see if maybe there is a reference to garbage there.    If my assumption is right, I am truly sorry you feel that way, and would like to know why.  My first thought was to give you a one, and recommend for disqualification, but I feel that that would be unfair as you have a right to your opinion.  So, I am going to pretend that the book shown is something I think is garbage, and rate the picture accordingly.<br/><br/>The composition is pretty good, but the tight cropping gives it a tight feel.  The lighting seems a little off which gives the entire picture a yellowish tint or cast.  Finally, the focus could be a little sharper.  4 karmat</td>', 'Okay, I am assuming that you are saying the Bible, or the book of Isaiah, is garbage.  If i had my Bible handy, or if I could read the page, I would look to see if maybe there is a reference to garbage there.    If my assumption is right, I am truly sorry you feel that way, and would like to know why.  My first thought was to give you a one, and recommend for disqualification, but I feel that that would be unfair as you have a right to your opinion.  So, I am going to pretend that the book shown is something I think is garbage, and rate the picture accordingly.The composition is pretty good, but the tight cropping gives it a tight feel.  The lighting seems a little off which gives the entire picture a yellowish tint or cast.  Finally, the focus could be a little sharper.  4 karmat', '2002-10-07 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
