(136528, 6752, 3942, '<td valign="top">WOW - so much comments on a 5 pts shot. Thanks a million to all of you for telling me your opinion! I like the pic myself, because you have to stop for a moment to get the point. Some of you were interested in the story behind this shot, but there is no special story. My girlfriend and me were on a weekend walk. I didn''t had any ideas for the challenge by the time. But then I found this big roadside billboard and the blue plasic bottle just aside. I asked my girlfried to act as if she is in the poster. The rest was a little bit cropping and hoping, that the blue bottle and the title is enough to meet the challenge. Perhaps I was wrong in this point. But when I look on the score I think, that my actress was a little too perfect  :-). Was it really so difficult to realise, that this is not only o photo of a photo?</td>', 'WOW - so much comments on a 5 pts shot. Thanks a million to all of you for telling me your opinion! I like the pic myself, because you have to stop for a moment to get the point. Some of you were interested in the story behind this shot, but there is no special story. My girlfriend and me were on a weekend walk. I didn''t had any ideas for the challenge by the time. But then I found this big roadside billboard and the blue plasic bottle just aside. I asked my girlfried to act as if she is in the poster. The rest was a little bit cropping and hoping, that the blue bottle and the title is enough to meet the challenge. Perhaps I was wrong in this point. But when I look on the score I think, that my actress was a little too perfect  :-). Was it really so difficult to realise, that this is not only o photo of a photo?', '2002-10-14 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
