(136553, 6753, 3080, '<td valign="top">Funny shot.  One of my favorites this week.  My only complaint is the semi-harsh lighting.  There are a few blown out spots in the white cups and on the hand.  Overall though, the concept is great, nd the angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  Focus is wonderful.  Nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Funny shot.  One of my favorites this week.  My only complaint is the semi-harsh lighting.  There are a few blown out spots in the white cups and on the hand.  Overall though, the concept is great, nd the angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  Focus is wonderful.  Nice shot! Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-13 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
