 Now you can see why I laughed The shot itself is just superb, and even if I could find fault I wouldn''t. It has been thought provoking and entertaining for the last twenty minutes. (10) Great photography and invention</td>', 'This is a really clever and superbly executed shot.  I don''t look at titles until I have studied the picture, and I laughed when I saw what you had called it.  I realise, from the title, the intent was a play upon talking rubbish, but you might be interested in my first opinion, thus:  The sense of projectile movement and the wide, open mouth in the shot carries the message that garbage is the vomit of society; I like the concept, but I think a tastefully positioned bare bottom  whilst more controversial  would have carried the message even better Now you can see why I laughed The shot itself is just superb, and even if I could find fault I wouldn''t. It has been thought provoking and entertaining for the last twenty minutes. (10) Great photography and invention', '2002-10-09 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(137045, 6794, 3080, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this, I thought it was a photo of bad breath. lol.  your focus and clarity are great. Use of garbage is quite obvious and very creative.  The angle and framing/cropping is good, and i like how you have filled the frame of the photo.  Nice shot, one of the best this week. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'When I first looked at this, I thought it was a photo of bad breath. lol.  your focus and clarity are great. Use of garbage is quite obvious and very creative.  The angle and framing/cropping is good, and i like how you have filled the frame of the photo.  Nice shot, one of the best this week. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-09 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
