(137095, 6796, 3604, '<td valign="top">In answer to the question, No I didn''t misappropriate the stop sign.  I was able to borrow a damaged one from my city''s sign shop for the shoot to allow me to make my "statement".  The really sad part is that this is a creek 500 feet away from a man made lake called Lake McKinney.  I''m forwarding my shots to the city to see what can be done.  If that doesn''t work I''m sending the shots to the city newspaper.  Who knows, may it can be stopped. . .</td>', 'In answer to the question, No I didn''t misappropriate the stop sign.  I was able to borrow a damaged one from my city''s sign shop for the shoot to allow me to make my "statement".  The really sad part is that this is a creek 500 feet away from a man made lake called Lake McKinney.  I''m forwarding my shots to the city to see what can be done.  If that doesn''t work I''m sending the shots to the city newspaper.  Who knows, may it can be stopped. . .', '2002-10-14 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
