 The composition with the bin, the winding path, the colour  in fact, in every other aspect it''s a potential high scoring shot.  However, the people are the first thing I see when I look at the shot and I don''t even think you wanted them there The draw away is being caused by the angles within the picture focussing  like cross hairs - the attention towards the splash of colour (red in this case) that isn''t the intended subject Without the people, 9 (10 even), with the people, sorry, (4)  I think the subliminal effect here could cause this shot to wind up with a fairly low score Keep shooting</td>', 'Everything about this shot screams out class  with one exception; the people in the shot kill it almost stone dead The composition with the bin, the winding path, the colour  in fact, in every other aspect it''s a potential high scoring shot.  However, the people are the first thing I see when I look at the shot and I don''t even think you wanted them there The draw away is being caused by the angles within the picture focussing  like cross hairs - the attention towards the splash of colour (red in this case) that isn''t the intended subject Without the people, 9 (10 even), with the people, sorry, (4)  I think the subliminal effect here could cause this shot to wind up with a fairly low score Keep shooting', '2002-10-09 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
